# Firmware Conventions

## Images
- Draw frames with `tft.pushImage(0, 0, CAKE_W, CAKE_H, CAKE_FRAMES[i])`
- Always call `tft.setSwapBytes(true)` once in `setup()` — never per draw
- Frame arrays live in `include/cake_frames.h`; add new frames there

## Buzzer
- Use `tone(PIN_BUZZER, freq, ms)` then `delay(ms)` then `noTone(PIN_BUZZER)`
- Add `delay(30)` between notes to prevent audio glitching
- Rest: `freq == 0` → skip `tone()`, just `delay(ms)`

## Button / power
- Prefer `INPUT_PULLUP` + active-LOW (button connects pin to GND)
- For battery builds with power switch: remove button logic, auto-play on boot, loop or deep sleep after

## Deep sleep (when used)
```cpp
esp_sleep_enable_ext0_wakeup(GPIO_NUM_33, 0); // wake on LOW
esp_deep_sleep_start();
```
